==== hyperbricks yaml {!{plugin}} ====
plugin:
  - type: plugin
  - attributes:
      data-role: demo
  - plugin: example
==== explainer ====
Extra attributes like id, data-role, data-action
==== expected json ====
{
  "Classes": null,
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<PLUGIN>",
  "Data": null,
  "Enclose": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": {
    "data-role": "demo"
  },
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "PluginName": "example"
}

==== expected output ====
<div data-role="demo">Plugin example</div>
